{"id":17282,"title":"Efficient computation and rendering of smoke animation","url":"http://hdl.handle.net/2346/16985","final_url":"https://ttu-ir.tdl.org/server/api/core/bitstreams/ad9edad3-6e1b-496f-96b6-b4736f1619e4/content","year":2006,"kind":"paper","source":"openalex","doi":null,"arxiv":null,"sha256":"e561d816deb0c0fbb3750a83bf6f9f2cbfbab07e4870df5b6e537cb929337c91","ctype":"application/pdf","text_src":"human","fetched_at":1793056409.0592694,"text_chars":98835,"abstract":"This thesis reviews several key concepts and equations which are vital to the creation of a physically credible and realistic smoke animation. The main contributions of this thesis include the reorganization of the scene by distance to permit the proper interaction between a translucent gas and its surrounding environment, the incorporation of a hash table to minimize the storage needed for the smoke's density, and an API for future developers looking to create a smoke simulation.","file":null,"marks":["unofficial"],"links":["https://ttu-ir.tdl.org/server/api/core/bitstreams/ad9edad3-6e1b-496f-96b6-b4736f1619e4/content","http://hdl.handle.net/2346/16985","https://ttu-ir.tdl.org/bitstreams/ad9edad3-6e1b-496f-96b6-b4736f1619e4/download"],"cited_by":[{"path":"13472-general-fluid-simulation-update-loop.md","name":"General Fluid Simulation Update Loop","k":5},{"path":"14666-lamorlette-and-foster-fire-model.md","name":"Lamorlette and Foster Fire Model","k":3},{"path":"14659-navier-stokes-fire-simulation.md","name":"Navier-Stokes Fire Simulation","k":3},{"path":"17940-height-curve-activation-voxel-column-generation.md","name":"Height Curve Activation & Voxel Column Generation","k":2},{"path":"18556-hash-map-based-sparse-data-structure.md","name":"Hash Map-based Sparse Data Structure","k":1},{"path":"20254-depth-sorting-for-transparency.md","name":"Depth Sorting for Transparency","k":1},{"path":"20133-connected-component-labeling.md","name":"Connected Component Labeling","k":5},{"path":"20270-pressure-gradient-flow-control.md","name":"Pressure Gradient Flow Control","k":1},{"path":"23081-target-driven-smoke-animation.md","name":"Target-Driven Smoke Animation","k":1},{"path":"20293-hybrid-particle-level-set-method.md","name":"Hybrid Particle-Level Set Method","k":1}]}